  m_text: '<color=yellow>MOUSE 1</color>  -> Primary Attack

    <color=yellow>MOUSE
    2</color> -> Secondary Attack

    <color=yellow>SPACE</color> -> Dodge Roll

    <color=yellow>W
    A S D</color> -> Movement

    <color=yellow>''E''</color> -> Interaction Button

    <color=yellow>''Q''</color>
    -> Drink Potion

    <color=yellow>''R''</color> -> Drop Weapon

    <color=yellow>''1''</color>
    -> Drop Item in Slot 1

    <color=yellow>''2''</color> -> Drop Item in Slot
    2

    <color=yellow>''3''</color> -> Drop Item in Slot 3


    You have <color=yellow>5</color>
    lives, finish the dungeon before they run out, or go back to the beginning.'
