    - target: {fileID: 6629488621914124785, guid: 74fac110494b2404680b7c83145d743d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "There's a shadow following me, i don't know for how long, but it always
        seems to disappear when i take notice of it, and it's image becomes blurred
        in my mind, like it was part of a nightmare i just woke up from.\n\nHas it
        been days, weeks, years? \nIt feels like an eternity down here."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
